    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Your name"
      },
      "tipo": "presentate",
      "dice": {
        "en": "**¿Cómo te llamas?** That means «What's your name?» Type your name and I'll show you how to answer in Spanish."
      },
      "plantilla": "Me llamo {x}.",
      "despues": {
        "en": "¡Hola, {x}! **Me llamo {x}** is your answer. Word for word it is «I call myself {x}». Now two quick questions."
      },
      "preguntas": [
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "Now YOU ask ME my name. Which one is the question?"
          },
          "opciones": [
            {
              "texto": "¿Cómo te llamas?",
              "correcta": true,
              "explica": {
                "en": "**Soy** tu tutora. ¡Encantada, {x}! Did you see? I answered with **soy**: «I am»."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": "Me llamo {x}.",
              "explica": {
                "en": "That is your answer, not a question. Look for the **¿ ?** signs."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": "Encantada.",
              "explica": {
                "en": "That means «pleased to meet you». Look for the **¿ ?** signs."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "There is a shorter way to say your name. Which one?"
          },
          "opciones": [
            {
              "texto": "Soy {x}.",
              "correcta": true,
              "explica": {
                "en": "Yes! **Soy {x}** = «I am {x}». Both **Me llamo {x}** and **Soy {x}** are fine."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": "Eres {x}.",
              "explica": {
                "en": "**Eres** means «you are». That is what I would say to you!"
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": "Te llamas {x}.",
              "explica": {
                "en": "**Te llamas** means «you are called». That is about you, said by someone else."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Your name"
      },
      "tipo": "elige-pieza",
      "dice": {
        "en": "Listen to **me llamo**: «me YA-mo». One of these pieces sounds like the **y** in «yes». Tap it!"
      },
      "escucha": "me llamo",
      "piezas": [
        "m",
        "e",
        "ll",
        "a",
        "m",
        "o"
      ],
      "correcta": 2,
      "mal": {
        "en": "Not that one. Listen again: me **YA**-mo. Which letters make the **y** sound?"
      },
      "bien": {
        "en": "That's it! In Spanish **ll** sounds like the **y** in «yes»: **llamo** = «YA-mo»."
      }
    },
    {
